```

Note `threshold < 0` **strict**: 2n+2 == 80 (n=39) leaves `threshold == 0` → *not* hashed; 2n+2 == 82 (n=40) → `-2` → hashed. Confirmed by n=39/n=40 both matching. Also note the bbox loop starts at `outerNode->next` but seeds min/max from `outerNode`, so it covers the whole ring.

